          "value": "xywh=pixel:531.4267578125,312.1107177734375,2456.169189453125,2819.9156494140625",
          "conformsTo": "http://www.w3.org/TR/media-frags/"
        }
      },
      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "value": "<p>I would like to inform my lord the sheikh\u2014God [Allah] preserve his strength!\u2014that Abu \u2019l-\u1e24asan, no sooner had he been given over [to my care] than his eye was on his schoolwork. But I have to inform [my lord] what happened to him: [another child called] Abu \u2019l-\u1e24asan ibn Wuhayb rose up and broke his writing-board with the full knowledge of the other boys. Greetings.</p>\n<p></p>",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
      "motivation": [
        "sc:supplementing",
        "translating"
      ],
